          "description": "Whether a straight-alpha colour source is premultiplied once at upload, in linear light and before filtering and mip generation, so edges do not fringe. Defaults to true for colour textures. It normalizes storage and never multiplies a source that is already premultiplied; a 'none' source cannot request it."
